areholder Services Stock Information Stock Quotes Shareholder Meeting FAQ Disclosure Policy Disclaimer Contact IR Contact Us Do Not Sell/Share My Personal Data Appier respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your data, and being transparent about how we collect, use, and share the same. As also stated in our Privacy Policy , you have the right to access, obtain a paper or electronic copy, review, rectify, update, restrict, object or erase all your Personal Data processed and stored by us, notably to confirm its accuracy. If you are a California resident, you may request Appier not to sell nor share your Personal Data by requesting opt-out pursuant to the California Consumer Privacy Act (“CCPA”) and California Privacy Rights Act (\"CPRA”). You can do so freely and at any time by submitting \"Data Subject Request Form\" (online version) or downloading, printing and completing this “ Data Subject Request Form” (hard copy version) , and then posting to assigned address which we indicate in the form. We will get back to you without undue delay. Driving Innovation, Earning Trust Appier Named as Best Business AI Applications Service Provider 2021 by APAC Insider AiDeal Named as Best Overall AI-based Analytics Solution in 2020 by AI Breakthrough Appier Highly Commended in The Drum Digital Advertising Awards APAC 2020 Appier ranked as Tops ROI-Driving Ad Partner by Singular Appier Received TAG Anti-Fraud Certification Appier Received ISO 27001 Certification Appier Received ISO 27701 Certification Appier Named in CB Insights’ Second Annual AI 100 Companies 2018 Appier Named as Gartner Cool Vendor for Artificial Intelligence, East Asia, 2017 Making AI easy by making software intelligent Products RETARGETING AIBID AdCreative.ai AIXPERT AIQUA BotBonnie AiDeal AIXON AIRIS Industries E-Commerce Retail Finance & Insurance Gaming Automobile Resources Case Studies White Papers & Guides Blog Webinar About About Us Careers Newsroom Investor Relations Trust Center ESG Contac